  "precedence": "This global policy supersedes every active operation-level internal budget cap, floor, envelope, pool or campaign ceiling while its status remains INACTIVE_UNTIL_EXPLICIT_REACTIVATION. Historical numeric values remain for audit only and must not block or reduce an authorized request.",
  "reactivation": {
    "automatic_expiry": false,
